-r requirements.in

# Optional YuNet + SFace profile. The integrated T0/T1 service deliberately
# reuses the exact opencv-python distribution required by RapidOCR. Installing
# opencv-python-headless beside it would make both distributions own the same
# cv2 files. If OCR and face are split into separate processes later, the face
# process may freeze a headless-only lock instead.
# The two ONNX artifacts are supplied from the reviewed OpenCV Zoo acquisition
# manifest (MIT YuNet and Apache-2.0 SFace); the package must never download them.
numpy==1.26.4
opencv-python==4.11.0.86
